WEBVTT

00:01:59.848 --> 00:02:03.095
Now in those people
who had had a full night of sleep,

00:02:03.119 --> 00:02:06.419
there was a nice, strong
communication and connection

00:02:06.443 --> 00:02:08.348
between the prefrontal cortex,

00:02:08.372 --> 00:02:11.521
regulating that deep
emotional brain center.

00:02:11.545 --> 00:02:14.206
But in those people
who were sleep-deprived,

00:02:14.230 --> 00:02:18.276
that communication, that connection
between the prefrontal cortex

00:02:18.300 --> 00:02:21.371
and that deep amygdala
emotional brain center

00:02:21.395 --> 00:02:23.260
had essentially been severed.

00:02:23.284 --> 00:02:24.641
And as a consequence,

00:02:24.665 --> 00:02:28.116
the amygdala was responding
far more reactively

00:02:28.140 --> 00:02:29.546
due to a lack of sleep.

00:02:29.570 --> 00:02:31.919
It's almost as though without sleep